            <p id="rpa-table-3.1" class="border-t border-orange-100 bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-50/90 to-amber-50/50 px-4 py-3 text-center text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:border-orange-950/40 dark:from-slate-800/90 dark:to-slate-900/50 dark:text-slate-200" style="scroll-margin-top: 100px;">
                Tableau 3.1 — Zones sismiques
